AgreementApplicationService -[hidden]down-> OutboxDispatcher
LearningAgreement ..> AgreementIntegrationEvent : confirmByHost / cancel
note bottom of AgreementApplicationService
  CF08 / BR-08: confirmHost, nu simpla aprobare a facultății.
  LA + audit + append(event) în aceeași tranzacție.
  HOST_CONFIRMED / CANCELLED identifică evenimentele
  LearningAgreementConfirmedByHost / LearningAgreementCancelled.
end note
note bottom of OutboxDispatcher
  Publică după commit; markPublished numai după confirmarea
  transportului. Retry poate produce duplicate (at-least-once).
end note

LearningAgreementRepoJPA -[hidden]down-> OutboxRepoJPA
OutboxRepoJPA -[hidden]down-> OutboxDispatcher
OutboxDispatcher -[hidden]down-> MessagePublisherAdapter
remove AgreementOutbound
hide members
show AgreementIntegrationEvent fields
show AgreementEventType members
